[00:13.375]I know a place we could waste our time
{"我知道有个地方能虚度时光"}
[00:16.639]Take the back roads to ocean drive
{"沿着小路驶向海滨大道"}
[00:19.828]Windows down wanna breathe the tide
{"摇下车窗 呼吸潮汐的味道"}
[00:26.079]I used to come here to feel the breeze
{"我曾常来这里感受微风"}
[00:29.420]Seashells dangling from the keys
{"贝壳风铃在钥匙上晃动"}
[00:32.627]New to freedom at seventeen
{"十七岁初尝自由滋味"}
[00:37.447]Maybe we could stay here counting stars
{"或许我们可以躺着数星星"}
[00:40.607]Watching all the planes take dreamers far away from here
{"看飞机载着追梦人远去"}
[00:46.672]Away from here
{"远离此地"}
[00:50.251]On the hood with hand rolled cigarettes
{"倚在车头抽着手卷烟"}
[00:53.415]Talking bout how we're both gonna get away from here
{"聊着总有一天要远走高飞"}
[00:59.425]Away from here
{"远离此地"}
[01:02.816]Somewhere summer never ends
{"去夏日永驻的远方"}
