{"远行"}
[02:37.439]What if we went south on 95
{"若沿95号公路一路向南"}
[02:40.671]Just left right now no sad goodbyes
{"此刻出发 不必伤感道别"}
[02:43.913]Didn't stop till tomorrow night
{"直到明晚都别停下"}
[02:48.773]Got no money and got no plan
{"身无分文 也无计划"}
[02:51.884]I know no one would understand
{"我知道没人会明白"}
[02:55.516]The story of another pair of lovers who just up and ran
{"另一对恋人突然私奔的故事"}
[03:01.307]Or maybe we could stay here counting stars
